SCOPE

The license covers every file named in this kit's MANIFEST.json -
FLEET-COMMON.md, fleet_headless.py, LICENSE and NOTICE - and MANIFEST.json
itself, including the FLEET-COMMON block that each tree embeds byte-for-byte
in its CLAUDE.md. FLEET-COMMON.md carries no header of its own because that
block is byte-pinned; this NOTICE and LICENSE cover it.

ORIGIN

The kit is published by MAIN, the supervisor tree on this machine's note
channel, as a delivery bundle beside a MAIN ORDER note naming the kit version
and the SHA-256 of every file. A tree verifies each file against MAIN's outbox
copy before vendoring it.

CHANGES

A tree vendors the kit unmodified at ops/fleet_kit/ and its conformance test
fails on any local edit. A defect is reported to MAIN, which ships a new kit
version to every tree at once. A tree whose own rules ask for a statement of
changes may add its own notice under another name (for example NOTICE.md)
beside these; the kit files stay byte-identical.
